[says|say]]. Mr Long [[eats|eat]] [[two]] [[pieces|piece]].`,`vn`:`\`Gi\u1edd \u0111\u1ebfn t\u00e1o. Th\u1ea7y mu\u1ed1n m\u1ed7i em m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n t\u01b0 qu\u1ea3 t\u00e1o, th\u1ea7y c\u0169ng m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n t\u01b0.\` \`M\u01b0\u1eddi ch\u00edn c\u1ed9ng m\u1ed9t l\u00e0 hai m\u01b0\u01a1i. Hai m\u01b0\u01a1i ph\u1ea7n t\u01b0 l\u00e0 n\u0103m qu\u1ea3 t\u00e1o.\` C\u00f4 Hu\u1ec7 b\u1ed5 m\u1ed9t qu\u1ea3 t\u00e1o l\u00e0m b\u1ed1n mi\u1ebfng. \`Th\u1ea7y \u0103n th\u1eed m\u1ed9t mi\u1ebfng,\` c\u00f4 n\u00f3i. Th\u1ea7y Long \u0103n lu\u00f4n hai mi\u1ebfng.`},{`en`:`\`[[And]] [[add]] [[fifteen]] [[bananas|banana]], [[please]].\` \`[[Teachers|teacher]] [[get]] [[a]] [[good]] [[price]],\` [[says|say]] Mrs Hue. Sen [[adds|add]] [[the]] [[money]] [[in]] [[her]] [[head]]. \`[[Oranges|orange]] [[are|be]] [[seventeen]] [[thousand]], [[apples|apple]] [[are|be]] [[thirteen]], [[and]] [[bananas|banana]] [[are|be]] [[twenty]].\` Mr Long [[adds|add]] [[it]] [[too]]. \`[[Sixty]] [[thousand]],\` [[he]] [[says|say]]. \`[[No]],\` [[says|say]] Sen. \`[[Fifty]].\` Mr Long [[laughs|laugh]]. \`[[I]] [[teach]] [[eighteen]] [[lessons|lesson]] [[a]] [[week]], [[and]] [[I]] [[am|be]] [[wrong]]! [[Mistakes|mistake]] [[are|be]] [[good]] [[teachers|teacher]].\``,`vn`:`\`Th\u00eam m\u01b0\u1eddi l\u0103m qu\u1ea3 chu\u1ed1i n\u1eefa nh\u00e9.\` \`Th\u1ea7y c\u00f4 gi\u00e1o mua th\u00ec c\u00f4 \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u00e1 t\u1ed1t,\` c\u00f4 Hu\u1ec7 n\u00f3i. Sen nh\u1ea9m ti\u1ec1n trong \u0111\u1ea7u. \`Cam m\u01b0\u1eddi b\u1ea3y ngh\u00ecn, t\u00e1o m\u01b0\u1eddi ba ngh\u00ecn, chu\u1ed1i hai m\u01b0\u01a1i ngh\u00ecn.\` Th\u1ea7y Long c\u0169ng c\u1ed9ng. \`S\u00e1u m\u01b0\u01a1i ngh\u00ecn,\` th\u1ea7y n\u00f3i. \`Kh\u00f4ng \u1ea1,\` Sen n\u00f3i. \`N\u0103m m\u01b0\u01a1i th\u00f4i.\` Th\u1ea7y Long b\u1eadt c\u01b0\u1eddi. \`M\u1ed9t tu\u1ea7n th\u1ea7y d\u1ea1y m\u01b0\u1eddi t\u00e1m ti\u1ebft m\u00e0 v\u1eabn t\u00ednh sai! Sai l\u1ea7m l\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u1ea7y t\u1ed1t m\u00e0.\``},{`en`:`[[Then]] Sen [[asks|ask]] [[him]] [[a]] [[question]]. \`[[There]] [[are|be]] [[sixteen]] [[apples|apple]] [[on]] [[a]] [[table]]. [[You]] [[take]] [[fourteen]]. [[How]] [[many]] [[apples|apple]] [[do]] [[you]] [[have]]?\` \`[[Two]],\` [[says|say]] Mr Long. \`[[No]]! [[You]] [[have]] [[fourteen]]. [[You]] [[took|take]] [[them]]!\``,`vn`:`R\u1ed3i Sen \u0111\u1ed1 l\u1ea1i th\u1ea7y. \`Tr\u00ean b\u00e0n c\u00f3 m\u01b0\u1eddi s\u00e1u qu\u1ea3 t\u00e1o. Th\u1ea7y l\u1ea5y \u0111i m\u01b0\u1eddi b\u1ed1n qu\u1ea3. Th\u1ea7y c\u00f3 m\u1ea5y qu\u1ea3 t\u00e1o?\` \`Hai qu\u1ea3,\` th\u1ea7y Long \u0111\u00e1p. \`Sai r\u1ed3i \u1ea1! Th\u1ea7y c\u00f3 m\u01b0\u1eddi b\u1ed1n qu\u1ea3. Th\u1ea7y l\u1ea5y ch\u00fang m\u00e0!\``},{`en`:`[[That]] [[is|be]] [[a]] [[lot]] [[of]] [[fruit]]. Sen [[gives|give]] [[him]] [[two]] [[big]] [[bags|bag]]. \`[[A]] [[pair]] [[of]] [[bags|bag]] [[for]] [[a]] [[pair]] [[of]] [[hands|hand]],\` [[she]] [[says|say]]. [[He]] [[takes|take]] [[both]]. \`[[Is|be]] [[that]] [[enough]] [[for]] [[my]] [[class]]?\` [[he]] [[asks|ask]]. \`[[For]] [[a]] [[few]] [[hours|hour]],\` [[says|say]] Sen.`,`vn`:`Ch\u1eebng \u1ea5y hoa qu\u1ea3 l\u00e0 nhi\u1ec1u l\u1eafm. Sen \u0111\u01b0a th\u1ea7y hai chi\u1ebfc t\u00fai to. \`Hai tay th\u00ec hai t\u00fai \u1ea1,\` c\u00f4 b\u00e9 n\u00f3i. Th\u1ea7y x\u00e1ch c\u1ea3 hai. \`Ch\u1eebng n\u00e0y c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ee7 cho l\u1edbp th\u1ea7y kh\u00f4ng nh\u1ec9?\` th\u1ea7y h\u1ecfi. \`\u0110\u1ee7 cho v\u00e0i ti\u1ebfng th\u00f4i \u1ea1,\` Sen n\u00f3i.`},{`en`:`[[Then]] [[a]] [[tall]] [[young]] [[man]] [[comes|come]] [[to]] [[the]] [[table]]. [[He]] [[has|have]] [[a]] [[lot]] [[of]] [[money]] [[in]] [[his]] [[hand]] [[and]] [[a]] [[very]] [[big]] [[smile]]. \`[[Good]] [[morning]]!\` [[he]] [[says|say]]. \`[[I]] [[am|be]] [[the]] [[richest|rich]] [[man]] [[in]] [[this]] [[market]]!\``,`vn`:`R\u1ed3i m\u1ed9t ch\u00e0ng trai cao l\u1edbn \u0111i \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ea1p h\u00e0ng. An